# Dockerfile-specific ignore for the sharded-test-server image.
#
# Unlike the root .dockerignore (used by the production kcp image), this build
# DOES need cmd/test-server and cmd/sharded-test-server in the context, because
# the whole point of the image is to ship the sharded test server. We still
# exclude the same build artifacts and workspace files as the root ignore.
#
# BuildKit (docker build) auto-detects this file next to the Dockerfile and it
# overrides the root .dockerignore. For buildah it is passed via --ignorefile.

bin/

go.work
go.work.sum
